      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## About Fractions\n\nFractions consist of two basic parts:\n\n- **Denominator** - the bottom number\n- **Numerator** - the top number\n\n### Example: Converting 1/8\" to Decimal\n\n1. Numerator (top number) = 1\n2. Denominator (bottom number) = 8\n3. Divide numerator by denominator: 1 ÷ 8 = **0.125**\n\n### Conversion Reference\n\n- 1 inch = 25.4 mm"
